  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The novel treats light path as a named cultivation path with mortal experts, assistance and combat Gu, and Immortal inheritances, not as a generic word for brightness.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recognizes Xiao Mang of Xiao clan as an expert of the light path who possesses rank five extreme light Gu. Extreme light Gu can burst out with immemorial light of glory that passes through everything, including a blessed land, though Xiao Mang’s incomplete Gu can be used only three times each month or it will self-destruct.",
      "chapters": [
        389
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_xiao_mang",
        "fac_xiao_clan",
        "gu_extreme_light_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Opening Di Qiu inheritance, Fang Yuan deploys rank one little light Gu, named a very famous light path assistance type Gu that lifts darkness. Light fences Gu, also from the light path and rank three, turn into fences that restrain a target. He also sends out three rank five light path Gu: lightning flash Gu for speed, unlimited spring light Gu for healing, and attack type heaven blazing spark Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        563
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "mortal-light-path-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_di_qiu_inheritance",
        "gu_unlimited_spring_light_gu",
        "gu_heaven_blazing_spark_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Zhou Min is a light path Gu Immortal nurtured by a past-generation Gu Immortal and holds sight light Immortal Gu. Her strongest move Farsight Weapon Light shoots golden white light from her eyes that cuts like blades and daggers, growing stronger with distance and weakening at close range. Inside Hei Fan grotto-heaven, Zhou Min’s light path inheritance is named among inheritances that came from criminal immortals rather than from Old Ancestor Hei Fan.",
      "chapters": [
        1126
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
